---
# Cluster Observability Operator: console plugin for Observe -> Traces. The plugin finds the
# Tempo instances of the cluster by itself (the CR has no field that selects one); the gitops
# repo deploys TempoMonolithic `tempo` in the namespace observability (see AGENTS.md §7).
apiVersion: observability.openshift.io/v1alpha1
kind: UIPlugin
metadata:
  name: {{ name }}
spec:
  type: DistributedTracing
